{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-136315" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "A particle moves with a constant velocity of $u=-2i\\,\\text{km/h}.$ Find the speed of the particle." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d8a3e00c425a9150cc5502fa4cb0da0fd28f7edbc3e3f41bb746db73ea4722"} {"question" "q-136315" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The speed of a particle equals the magnitude of its velocity.\n\nTherefore, the speed of the particle is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|u| & =|-2i| \\\\  & =|-2| \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nkilometers per hour." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d8a3e00c425a9150cc5502fa4cb0da0fd28f7edbc3e3f41bb746db73ea4722"} {"question" "q-136315" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7f299e7929890cff147e1e9313cb7800670f9c1cb6cf26837c9cb420b0275ee4"} {"question" "q-136315" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d8a3e00c425a9150cc5502fa4cb0da0fd28f7edbc3e3f41bb746db73ea4722"} {"question" "q-136315" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\,\\text{km/h}"] ["math" "4\\,\\text{km/h}"] ["math" "\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{km/h}"] ["math" "\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{km/h}"] ["math" "\\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{km/h}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d8a3e00c425a9150cc5502fa4cb0da0fd28f7edbc3e3f41bb746db73ea4722"} {"question" "q-136315" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2\\,\\text{km/h}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d8a3e00c425a9150cc5502fa4cb0da0fd28f7edbc3e3f41bb746db73ea4722"} {"question" "q-136311" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "A particle moves with a constant velocity of $u=(2i-5j)\\,\\text{m/s}.$ Find the speed of the particle, rounding your answer to two decimal places." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d8a3e00c425a9150cc5502fa4cb0da0fd28f7edbc3e3f41bb746db73ea4722"} {"question" "q-136311" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The speed of a particle equals the magnitude of its velocity.\n\nTherefore, the speed of the particle is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|u| & =|2i-5j| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+25} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{29} \\\\  & ≈5.39\\,\\text{m/s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to two decimal places." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d8a3e00c425a9150cc5502fa4cb0da0fd28f7edbc3e3f41bb746db73ea4722"} {"question" "q-136311" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7f299e7929890cff147e1e9313cb7800670f9c1cb6cf26837c9cb420b0275ee4"} {"question" "q-136311" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979841/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d8a3e00c425a9150cc5502fa